// Game animals and what they are made of (travel spec 4.5; butchery clothing-warmth-exposure.md 4.8). `butcher` maps a tissue material to a good; share_pm are permille of the carcass mass,
// 175 permille gut contents and 50 blood are never recovered. Every creature the same way, so a new species is data only. Horn has no good yet and is folded into bone.
